# Both arities of `printf`, one module lending its value read-only past the
# `...`: refused on that module's parameter, the other module's binding of the
# same C name left alone (defect 2102's reader, 2026-10-17). Since panel 243's
# R1 (defect 2421, 2026-11-10) the other module's `value: i64` is refused too,
# as crossing by value, and each refusal is told on its own module's line in
# its own words.

use as_int
use as_text

function main()
    _ = as_int.say(format: "n = %d\n", value: 42)
    _ = as_text.say(format: "s = %s\n", value: "forty-two")
